BT /F2 9.7 Tf 0.16 0.18 0.23 rg 1 0 0 1 48.0 745.0 Tm (20. Why is average blood-flow velocity normally much lower in capillaries than in the aorta?) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.3 Tf 0.1 0.33 0.58 rg 1 0 0 1 48.0 728.3 Tm (Answer: D. The combined cross-sectional area of all capillaries is much larger.) Tj ET
