BT /F1 8.6 Tf 0.16 0.18 0.23 rg 1 0 0 1 48.0 682.8 Tm (Other options: Flow continues in capillaries; the key comparison is total cross-sectional area, not the diameter of one) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.6 Tf 0.16 0.18 0.23 rg 1 0 0 1 48.0 670.2 Tm (capillary.) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.2 Tf 0.43 0.45 0.49 rg 1 0 0 1 48.0 655.6 Tm (Source: DOM-CVS-0020 | CIRCULATION 1, pp. 61, 67) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.7 Tf 0.16 0.18 0.23 rg 1 0 0 1 48.0 632.4 Tm (21. A patient develops marked polycythaemia. If vascular diameter and pressure gradient are otherwise) Tj ET
