BT /F2 9.3 Tf 0.1 0.33 0.58 rg 1 0 0 1 48.0 714.6 Tm (Answer: C. Diastolic arterial pressure) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.16 0.18 0.23 rg 1 0 0 1 48.0 698.3 Tm (Explanation: As cuff pressure falls below diastolic pressure, the brachial artery is open throughout the cardiac) Tj ET
