BT /F2 9.7 Tf 0.16 0.18 0.23 rg 1 0 0 1 48.0 745.0 Tm (31. During exercise, working skeletal muscle produces more CO2, H+ and other metabolites. What local) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.7 Tf 0.16 0.18 0.23 rg 1 0 0 1 48.0 731.3 Tm (vascular response is expected?) Tj ET
