BT /F1 8.6 Tf 0.16 0.18 0.23 rg 1 0 0 1 48.0 555.4 Tm (Other options: A myogenic response differs from metabolic vasodilation caused by increased tissue activity.) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.2 Tf 0.43 0.45 0.49 rg 1 0 0 1 48.0 540.8 Tm (Source: DOM-CVS-0032 | CIRCULATION 2, pp. 8-10) Tj ET
