BT /F1 8.6 Tf 0.16 0.18 0.23 rg 1 0 0 1 48.0 441.7 Tm (Other options: Reactive hyperaemia is a temporary local response to preceding flow interruption.) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.2 Tf 0.43 0.45 0.49 rg 1 0 0 1 48.0 427.1 Tm (Source: DOM-CVS-0033 | CIRCULATION 2, pp. 5-6, 11) Tj ET
