BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.16 0.18 0.23 rg 1 0 0 1 48.0 685.2 Tm (in the third and lateral ventricles.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.6 Tf 0.16 0.18 0.23 rg 1 0 0 1 48.0 669.1 Tm (Other options: The fourth ventricle lies downstream of the aqueduct and is not the primary site of enlargement in an) Tj ET
