BT /F1 7.2 Tf 0.43 0.45 0.49 rg 1 0 0 1 48.0 641.9 Tm (Source: DOM-CVS-0047 | Regional Circulation, pp. 6-9, 16) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.7 Tf 0.16 0.18 0.23 rg 1 0 0 1 48.0 618.7 Tm (48. Brain capillary endothelial cells have tight junctions. How does glucose normally cross into brain) Tj ET
