BT /F1 7.2 Tf 0.43 0.45 0.49 rg 1 0 0 1 48.0 301.9 Tm (Source: DOM-CVS-0050 | Regional Circulation, pp. 26-28) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.7 Tf 0.16 0.18 0.23 rg 1 0 0 1 48.0 278.7 Tm (51. A region of heart muscle works harder and uses more oxygen. Which local change helps increase coronary) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.7 Tf 0.16 0.18 0.23 rg 1 0 0 1 48.0 265.0 Tm (blood flow?) Tj ET
